<%- include('partials/header') %>

<h1>網站設計</h1>
<p style="color:#666; margin-bottom:24px;">呢度改嘅嘢會即時套用去前台所有頁面，唔使重新部署。</p>

<form method="POST" action="/admin/theme" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="admin-form">

  <h3 style="margin:0;">顏色</h3>
  <div class="form-row">
    <label>主色調 (連結/按鈕/強調色)
      <input type="color" name="theme_primary_color" value="<%= theme.theme_primary_color %>">
    </label>
    <label>背景色
      <input type="color" name="theme_bg_color" value="<%= theme.theme_bg_color %>">
    </label>
    <label>文字色
      <input type="color" name="theme_text_color" value="<%= theme.theme_text_color %>">
    </label>
  </div>

  <h3 style="margin:0;">字體</h3>
  <label>字體 (CSS font-family值，可以填多個fallback)
    <input type="text" name="theme_font_family" value="<%= theme.theme_font_family %>">
  </label>
  <label>Google Fonts連結 (可選，去 fonts.google.com 揀字體，複製個 &lt;link&gt; 網址貼入嚟)
    <input type="text" name="theme_google_font_url" value="<%= theme.theme_google_font_url %>" placeholder="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=...">
  </label>
  <p style="font-size:13px; color:#888; margin-top:-8px;">
    貼咗Google Fonts連結之後，記得喺上面「字體」欄填返個字體名，例如 <code>'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif</code>
  </p>

  <h3 style="margin:0;">Logo</h3>
  <label>上傳新Logo
    <input type="file" name="logo_file" accept="image/*">
  </label>
  <img class="thumb-preview" src="<%= theme.theme_logo %>">
  <input type="hidden" name="existing_logo" value="<%= theme.theme_logo %>">

  <h3 style="margin:0;">自訂CSS (進階)</h3>
  <label>直接寫CSS，可以覆蓋任何樣式 (留空即可)
    <textarea name="theme_custom_css" rows="8" style="font-family: monospace; font-size:13px;"><%= theme.theme_custom_css %></textarea>
  </label>

  <button type="submit" class="btn">儲存並套用</button>
  <a href="/zh" target="_blank" class="btn-secondary">預覽前台 ↗</a>
</form>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
